        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Post-Implementation Support – once our customer’s content is activated on the LiveOne App, we provide technical and network support, which includes 24/7 operational assistance and monitoring of our services and performance.",
