        "statement": "To the extent we are able to negotiate with our Crypto service providers based on our commercial relationship with them, we aim to negotiate specific contractual terms and conditions with our custodian that we believe will help establish, under existing law, that our property interest in the Crypto held by our custodian is not subject to the claims of the custodian’s creditors in the event the custodian enters bankruptcy, receivership or similar insolvency proceedings.",
