        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continuously redesign and develop our custom LiveOne App with interactive features that enhance the live music experience and, when combined with our platform’s functionality, unique features and underlying music service, create an immersive digital experience in and of itself.",
